ation why  did you think  voter registration and just making sure  people were signed up to be able to vote  um was one of the things you wanted to  focus on you know obviously everybody's  doing so many things but voter  registration i feel like that's the core  of the whole thing  is that why you chose to focus on that  absolutely i think there's two things at  play  number one i think you've got people who  are incredibly overwhelmed  life in the united states right now is  very very difficult people are trying to  make it through the day  get food on the table educate their  children and sometimes  the noise of the election feels really  really far away and you're just trying  to get through your days so maybe you're  not really focused  on how important your vote is i think  there's another  factor at play where people feel um  disenfranchised and feel like  my vote doesn't mean anything uh i don't  know that i really like either candidate  what does my vote mean  and those are the people that i really  really want to reach because every  single vote matters we learned that the  hard way in 2016.  we cannot rest on our laurels we cannot  relax i don't i'm not looking at any  polls  there's a reason there's a reason that  the gop  wants to make it difficult for you to  vote and it is because when people vote  republicans lose so  let's not give donald trump any reason  to be able to litigate this in the  courts let's have such a big win that it  is put to bed and this nightmare is  done you're i was just watching your  last guess and you know they're talking  about patience and this could go on for  i mean  i i'm as afraid as my hair is frizzy  right now like i can't take it anymore  so that's what's been my main motivating  factor  yeah i feel like all of us i mean you  spoke of it being a nightmare  and in some ways i feel like but i've  been awake and most nightmares i'm  asleep and then i wake up  and then the nightmare is over but this  feels just like it it got worse it was  child separation  charlottesville and it just kept going  and as a citizen  who just my core value is the equal  treatment of every  human being um this has been a difficult  four years speaking of rage  you've done a number of instagram lives  with your fellow actors about voting  obviously hollywood people are very much  involved  um in uh making sure that people are  turned out  and engaged in this election cycle you  know  why did you choose to step forward and  be outspoken  you know some people choose to stay  quiet and you haven't why  why do you choose to speak well a lot of  people will say  vote right on their social media but  they don't say who to vote for  i think now is the time to draw your  line in the sand and make it very clear  which side you are on this is not a  normal election  and these are not normal people um i  i just think that injustice  is so extreme and i don't think anybody  should leave it up to chance that people  don't really know where you stand  in this election i think it's more  important than ever to say  uh i don't agree to rushing a supreme  court justice in um  who has extreme religious views to help  donald trump  uh you know cheat and steal an election  i don't think that children should be  separated from their parents and that  almost 550 of them can't be reunited  with their families  i don't think that bill barr should act  as donald trump's personal  attorney to settle his personal scores i  would like  to have a government that has some sort  of plan for this awful virus  when you look at countries like south  korea japan  new zealand australia they don't have  special magic that we don't know about  they just have effective leadership and  government that is taking  care of their people we have a  government that's saying let it burn  through the populace and see who lives  and  oh well if you die you die that must be  jesus's will  well that's not how i think well how i  think is we are  smart people who can figure out how to  save as many lives as we possibly can so  these are the things that are on my mind  celina  there's a lot on my mind too all the  time i'm always wanting for people to  follow the science like they're doing in  those other countries so that we can get  through this  crisis and the pandemic leslie grossman  thank you so much and thank you for  your advocacy and also just being  awesome  i love you on american horror story and  i feel like i just did  one of my bucket list items

